<h1>Graduate programme</h1>

<p>Our graduate programme is a two-year rotational scheme for engineering, materials science and business graduates. Trainees spend six months in each of foundry operations, machining, quality and either supply chain or finance, before settling into a permanent role matched to their interests and the needs of the business.</p>

<p>Each graduate is assigned a mentor from the site management team and works towards a professional qualification relevant to their discipline over the course of the scheme. Recruitment normally opens in the autumn for a start the following September, with places split roughly evenly between Sheffield and Wrexham.</p>

<p>For this year's live vacancies, including graduate roles once recruitment opens, see <a href="/careers/openings">current openings</a>, or go back to the main <a href="/careers">careers</a> page.</p>
